      {% set slides = nepal2025Slides %}{% set label = "Nepal 2025 photos" %}
      {% include "partials/slideshow.njk" %}
    </div>
    <div class="trip__text reveal">
      <h2 class="display">NEPAL 2025</h2>
      <p>In 2025, the Envision team established two new computer labs in Nepal—one at Chandi Devi School in the mountainous village of Dukuchhap, and the other at AUM School in Budhanilkantha. With the support of local partners like the Vishal Group, these labs are now transforming classrooms into centers of digital learning, empowering hundreds of students with access to technology, educational resources, and a brighter future.</p>
      <a class="read-more" href="/post/two-years-twice-the-impact-envision-education-vishal-group-foundation-bridging-the-digital-divid/">READ MORE {{ arrow | safe }}</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="trip__video">
    {% set video = videos[0] %}
    {% include "partials/youtube.njk" %}
  </div>
</section>

