      <h2 class="display">NEPAL 2024</h2>
      <p>In 2024, the Envision team built two computer labs in Kathmandu, Nepal, one at Life Vision Academy (LVA) situated on a small mountain overlooking the Kathmandu Valley, and the second at Koseli, a school free of cost to attend for children in need located in the slum area of the city.</p>
