      <h2 class="display">ZHAOQING 2023</h2>
      <p>In our ZhaoQing2023 initiative, we visited a remote location school in Guangdong Province, located almost 200 km away from Guangzhou. Our efforts were met with overwhelming success and serve as a successful proof of concept for international trips and future labs. The lab served more than 250 students and transformed an empty classroom into a digital gateway to the world!</p>
